  "stem": "In right triangle \\(JKL\\), angle \\(K\\) is a right angle, \\(JL = 34\\), and \\(\\cos J = \\frac{8}{17}\\). What is the length of \\(\\overline{KL}\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "30"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "\\(\\cos J = \\frac{JK}{JL}\\), so \\(JK = 34 \\cdot \\frac{8}{17} = 16\\).",
    "\\(KL = \\sqrt{34^{2} - 16^{2}} = \\sqrt{900} = 30\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "JL=34\nJK=JL*Rational(8,17)\nans=sqrt(JL**2-JK**2)\nassert JK==16 and ans==30\nassert all(Rational(s)==ans for s in spr_answers)\n",
